# 📱 RESPONSE FORMATTER CODE NODE

## Node Configuration
**Type**: `n8n-nodes-base.code`
**Mode**: `runOnceForEachItem`
**Language**: JavaScript
**On Error**: `continueRegularOutput`

## Function Overview
Formats final JSON response with text and optional audio data

## Key Operations
1. **AI Response Extraction**: Multiple format handling
2. **Audio URL Generation**: Base64 embedding for voice
3. **CTA Generation**: Context-aware call-to-action
4. **Metadata Assembly**: Complete response structure

## AI Response Extraction
```javascript
let aiResponse = 'Thank you for your message.';
if (aiData.message) {
  aiResponse = aiData.message;
} else if (aiData.content) {
  aiResponse = aiData.content;
} else if (aiData.choices && aiData.choices[0]) {
  aiResponse = aiData.choices[0].message.content;
}
```

## Audio URL Generation (Voice Users)
```javascript
if (isVoiceInput) {
  const ttsData = $('TTS Generation').first();
  if (ttsData && ttsData.binary && ttsData.binary.audio_response) {
    audioUrl = `data:audio/mp3;base64,${ttsData.binary.audio_response.data}`;
  }
}
```

## Context-Aware CTAs
```javascript
switch (contextData.intent) {
  case 'emergency':
    ctaMessage = '🚨 Call (970) 446-8995 immediately!';
    break;
  case 'estimation_request':
    ctaMessage = contextData.has_email ? 
      `📞 I'll send details to ${contextData.user_email}` :
      '📞 What email should I send the estimate to?';
    break;
  case 'scheduling':
    ctaMessage = '📅 Book at https://calendly.com/alpinepeakroofing/inspection';
    break;
}
```

