# 📤 WEBHOOK RESPONSE NODE

## Node Configuration
**Type**: `n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook`
**Type Version**: 1.5
**On Error**: `continueRegularOutput`

## Required Settings
```javascript
{
  "respondWith": "json",
  "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
  "options": {}
}
```

## Response Structure
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "response": {
    "message": "AI response text",
    "audio_url": "data:audio/mp3;base64,..." | null,
    "type": "voice" | "text",
    "timestamp": "2024-01-01T12:00:00.000Z",
    "session_id": "session_123",
    "cta": "📞 Call (970) 446-8995 immediately!"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "input_type": "voice" | "text",
    "intent": "emergency",
    "priority": "urgent",
    "lead_score": 85,
    "email_captured": true,
    "knowledge_used": true
  }
}
```

## Frontend Integration
```javascript
fetch('/webhook/alpine-peak-chatbot', {
  method: 'POST',
  body: JSON.stringify({message: 'Need roof repair'})
})
.then(res => res.json())
.then(data => {
  // Display message
  showMessage(data.response.message);

  // Play audio if voice response
  if (data.response.audio_url) {
    const audio = new Audio(data.response.audio_url);
    audio.play();
  }

  // Show CTA
  showCTA(data.response.cta);
});
```

## Response Timing
- **Text Input**: ~2-4 seconds
- **Voice Input**: ~6-10 seconds (includes TTS)
- **Always responds**: Even on internal errors
